        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: English Water Spaniel, Estonian Hound\n- Topics: dog breeds, extinction, breeding history\n\nFacts:\n- The English Water Spaniel is a breed of dog that became extinct in the first part of the 20th century.\n- The last English Water Spaniel specimen was seen in the 1930s.\n- The Estonian Hound was bred in 1947 after the Soviet Union's national economy ministry decided that every country in the Union must have its own dog breed.",
